<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Citrix Systems.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Citrix Systems.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co raised the rating on Citrix Systems to Buy from Long-Term Attractive and raised EPS estimates.</p>
<p>-- Raised FY97 EPS estimates to $0.87 from $0.71 and released FY98 EPS estimates of $1.24.</p>
</text>
